An /italic phrase/ here, a (/word/) in parentheses, and one that ends with /word/.

A "/quoted/" and a “/curly/” word, and /a *b* c/ with strong inside.

/Start/ of a line,
and the end /of a line/
and /again/.

Punctuation: /one/, /two/; /three/: /four/! /why?/ —/dash/—

A link [/word/](http://x.com) and [a /b/ c](http://x.com).

- a /list/ item

| a | b |
|---|---|
| a /table/ cell | /x/ |

A footnote[fn: with /italic/ inside] here.
